    "detailed_description": "<h1>Comparative Grid</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345820/extras/2044e98e4e5568b8905466292973023c.avif?t=1753695521\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your hammers and pound the drums to epic tracks, from celtic rock to viking power metal. With dozens of official songs and thousands of community-made tracks, enjoy hours of fun as you play in perfect sync to carve your name on top of the leaderboard and race against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1<strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>46 songs</strong> in the base game from bands like Alestorm, Gloryhammer, Electric Callboy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 DLC adding <strong>49 extra tracks</strong> from bands like Sabaton, Miracle of Sound, Nightwish, The Offspring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to play, hard to master with <strong>3 difficulty levels</strong> for each song</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4500+ community-made tracks via<strong> custom song</strong> support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Public or private <strong>online PvP</strong> multiplayer (up to 6 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local split-screen</strong> mode for couch competition (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo races</strong> against your own best records as ghost ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VR compatible</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cross-platform multiplayer </strong>(PC &amp; VR players together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lots of stylised Nordic environments</strong> inspired by Viking mythology</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb6<strong>DLC LIST:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345820/extras/534321adb9a1fab5f5a3e8db24e3cacf.avif?t=1753695521\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your hammers and pound the drums to epic tracks, from celtic rock to viking power metal. With dozens of official songs and thousands of community-made tracks, enjoy hours of fun as you play in perfect sync to carve your name on top of the leaderboard and race against your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a1<strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>46 songs</strong> in the base game from bands like Alestorm, Gloryhammer, Electric Callboy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 DLC adding <strong>49 extra tracks</strong> from bands like Sabaton, Miracle of Sound, Nightwish, The Offspring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to play, hard to master with <strong>3 difficulty levels</strong> for each song</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4500+ community-made tracks via<strong> custom song</strong> support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Public or private <strong>online PvP</strong> multiplayer (up to 6 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local split-screen</strong> mode for couch competition (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo races</strong> against your own best records as ghost ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VR compatible</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cross-platform multiplayer </strong>(PC &amp; VR players together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lots of stylised Nordic environments</strong> inspired by Viking mythology</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb6<strong>DLC LIST:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1345820/extras/534321adb9a1fab5f5a3e8db24e3cacf.avif?t=1753695521\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Lead your viking ship to victory in this rhythm game! Pound your drums to the sound of epic music, from celtic rock to viking power metal, and set sail against your rivals. Solo, Split-Screen &amp; Online PVP included.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cYou know that scene in &quot;Mad Max: Fury Road&quot; where the cars are coming out after the good guys and they start drumming and rocking on the front of this war vehicle? That\u2019s this whole game \u2014 every song is you feeling like you\u2019re out there getting your crew to go faster and it\u2019s just brilliant.\u201d<br />\r\nUploadvr<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cRagnarock works as a party game and is sure to become a go-to when you have a few moments to spare or when you want to have a blast with your friends.\u201d<br />\r\nGamingTrend<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cRagnarock is the true heir to Guitar Hero.\u201d<br />\r\nMultiplayer.it<br />\r\n",
